<title>USA: Omaha hogs $0.25/0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $0.25/0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.25-0.50</p>
<p>lower. Top $56.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-270 lbs	    56.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-280 lbs    55.50-56.00</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. Weak to 1.00 lower. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-500 lbs  mostly  46.00, few 46.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    47.00-48.00</p>
</text>
